 debugger.

+This tool does the same thing. The sysmodule status line reports
+`found`, `sent`, `already`, `failed` and `too_big` for each scan, and the
+invariant is that every report found ends up in exactly one of the other
+four. If `found` is 3 and the rest add up to 2, a report went missing between being
